hared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"iQp3QlP4iynGTXgFqpZ7Gg","review_id":"H6I-q1-WREJ4WiiBjYywFA","date":"2018-06-13T15:45:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9472247958183289,"text_excerpt":"One of my fav spots for Mexican. We stopped in for a quick bite over the weekend and I was satisfied as usual with my meal...and some of everyone else's food at the table as well. I stuck with the a la carte tacos and a side of guacamole. I usually get the have quesadilla plate but opted for something a little lighter. The veggie fajitas were really good. The veggies didn't seem to be cooked all the way through so they still had a bit of texture which meant the seasoning didn't get all the way through. Of course we had a few cocktails and service was great as usual. I love the outside seating. The misting fans keep you cool in Hell's Kitchen during the summer months."},{"business_id":"iQp3QlP4iynGTXgFqpZ7Gg","review_id":"B3gAWKYDRh1-oIH4tk-1gw","date":"2013-06-24T19:13:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9463736414909363,"text_excerpt":"I'm kicking myself in the ass for not eating here more last year. I was turned off after my first visit when I ordered ceviche that was nearly inedible and was charge for a full extra shot when requesting a different tequila in my margarita. After nearly a year, I returned and now have an obsession with the place. First, the patio is awesome. Basically take Bulldog and add some amazing margaritas. Space is always limited though. Next, the margaritas are the best in the city. A new summer special is the cucumber orange margarita. It is heavenly. Fresh muddled orange and cucumber with agave nectar and a splash of sweet and sour. I do prefer a silver tequila over the standard but they haven'..."},{"business_id":"iQp3QlP4iynGTXgFqpZ7Gg","review_id":"iPCuTaBea8HCy8GOXrKp7Q","date":"2017-02-11T18:19:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9436571598052979,"text_excerpt":"Love their margaritas, strong and just the right amount of acidity and not too sweet. Tex mex eggrolls and the island jerk chicken are my absolute favorite, entrees are a little bit pricey with less portions compared to other Mexican restaurant around town but the food taste good so that makes up for it. I'm a big fan of the Cabo Quesadilla mixed shrimp and bacon together is divine and the decor inside is fun and funky and their service is always friendly. Wait time for a table can be long wait especially if they're busy so I suggest get a margarita in the bar while you wait for your table LOL."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iQp3QlP4iynGTXgFqpZ7Gg","photo_id":"kN930LqHoos24b5qFcvDKQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kN930LqHoos24b5qFcvDKQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9406638145446777},{"business_id":"iQp3QlP4iynGTXgFqpZ7Gg","photo_id":"HsuvzI6x-Fs0s9x6zEXZSg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HsuvzI6x-Fs0s9x6zEXZSg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9294496178627014},{"business_id":"iQp3QlP4iynGTXgFqpZ7Gg","photo_id":"DTGmmd6R2IBt4bnl3oLpYw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DTGmmd6R2IBt4bnl3oLpYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9042142629623413},{"business_id":"iQp3QlP4iynGTXgFqpZ7Gg","photo_id":"_RBNqWGGweEHH-200FAGEA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_RBNqWG